              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮನಗಾಣು — managāṇu — \"to realise\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನನ್ನ ತಪ್ಪನ್ನು ನಾನು ತಡವಾಗಿ ಮನಗಂಡೆ. nanna tappannu nānu taḍavāgi managaṇḍe. I realised my mistake late."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಮನಗಂಡೆ, managaṇḍe."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Its past is built on ಕಂಡ: ಮನಗಂಡನು, he realised."
            }
          ]
        },
