          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮನಗಾಣು (managāṇu) is built from two parts: mana, \"mind\" (Sanskrit manas, CDIAL 9822), and native kāṇ, \"to see\" (DEDR 1443): to see with the mind."
            }
          ]
        },
